SUMMARY:PRIVATE CLASS - SGPS - Yoga
LOCATION:Studio 4
DESCRIPTION:Strengthen\, stretch\, and sweat in this yoga class that incorporates meditation and breath-work with classic yoga poses. With variations offered in each pose\, you'll learn the foundations of yoga and find opportunities to challenge yourself in new ways. Suitable for all participant levels.\n\nNOTE: This class is only open to students in the Society of Graduate and Professional Students (SGPS).
